      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4002746928,
      "versionNonce": 266116357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784205942881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "分析主版本: Go 1.26.x  |  runtime/slice.go msize.go malloc.go  |  compile/internal/ir/cfg.go  escape/\n规范: Array/Slice types · Slice expressions · Append & copy · Length & capacity · Slice→array\n实现阈值: threshold=256 · MaxStackVarSize=128KiB · MaxImplicitStackVarSize=64KiB · MaxSmallArraySize=256B\n实现细节≠永久语言规范。更新 Go 后请重新核对源码。  |  目标画布宽 4200 · 紧凑网格布局",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "分析主版本: Go 1.26.x  |  runtime/slice.go msize.go malloc.go  |  compile/internal/ir/cfg.go  escape/\n规范: Array/Slice types · Slice expressions · Append & copy · Length & capacity · Slice→array\n实现阈值: threshold=256 · MaxStackVarSize=128KiB · MaxImplicitStackVarSize=64KiB · MaxSmallArraySize=256B\n实现细节≠永久语言规范。更新 Go 后请重新核对源码。  |  目标画布宽 4200 · 紧凑网格布局",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bD4",
      "version": null
    }
